            "review_title": "Review at Thai Express Sc Vivo City",
            "review_text": "Quang Kiet Le\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1197 contributions\n0\nGood combination of Thai and Vietnamese flavours\nAug 2024 • Couples\nThe restaurant is inside SC Vivo City, offering many fusion Thai dishes. The mango salad was really nice, and so did pad Thai and fried rice. Portions, however, were quite small, even for the Vietnamese.\nWritten August 20, 2024",
